nky si upravíte sami a ukážeme vám, jak na to.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "267038c", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "becd050", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d85a550", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "84b32c6", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8b6ca29", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Poptávka", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "dbe4007", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Nový web pro vaši firmu z Krnova?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "73e6e57", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Tvorba webových stránek Krnov začíná jednou zprávou. Napište pár vět nebo rovnou zavolejte – ozvu se obvykle do jednoho pracovního dne.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "787b104", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-contact", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "fe0689f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-person ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "92ae52b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "sett